{"name": "MR FARMBOY", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MR FARMBOY</strong> is a colony farming game with automation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build</strong> your <strong>dream farm</strong>, grow crops, raise animals, attract villagers, and hire workers to <strong>automate everything</strong>. <br/> <br/>\ud83c\udf31 <strong>Grow and Harvest Crops</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plant, water, and harvest a variety of crops on your dream farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"630\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795090/extras/6883ad533b400b5f5ca564cc305f397b.poster.avif?t=1777025705\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795090/extras/6883ad533b400b5f5ca564cc305f397b.webm?t=1777025705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795090/extras/6883ad533b400b5f5ca564cc305f397b.mp4?t=1777025705\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udc13 Raise Animals</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build Coops to raise chickens, ducks and geese, Barns to raise  pigs, sheep, and cows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"630\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795090/extras/94cdd8c475c92a9d234c839f01751eee.poster.avif?t=1777025705\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795090/extras/94cdd8c475c92a9d234c839f01751eee.webm?t=1777025705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795090/extras/94cdd8c475c92a9d234c839f01751eee.mp4?t=1777025705\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f Build Your Farm</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Construct Markets, Houses, Warehouses , Coops, Barns, and more to grow your farming empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"630\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795090/extras/53d30a49d9ed7c50d17d476a09b3e82c.poster.avif?t=1777025705\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795090/extras/53d30a49d9ed7c50d17d476a09b3e82c.webm?t=1777025705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795090/extras/53d30a49d9ed7c50d17d476a09b3e82c.mp4?t=1777025705\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Automate Your Farm</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hire Farmers, Gatherers, and Carriers to fully automate production and logistics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"630\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795090/extras/eccc774a896f64bc94882a5de22eaf31.poster.avif?t=1777025705\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795090/extras/eccc774a896f64bc94882a5de22eaf31.webm?t=1777025705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795090/extras/eccc774a896f64bc94882a5de22eaf31.mp4?t=1777025705\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcb0 Sell to Villagers </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Attract villagers to your farm and sell your goods to them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"314\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795090/extras/a13e8a02e8997bccc4bb805a29bb6e47.poster.avif?t=1777025705\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795090/extras/a13e8a02e8997bccc4bb805a29bb6e47.webm?t=1777025705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795090/extras/a13e8a02e8997bccc4bb805a29bb6e47.mp4?t=1777025705\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83e\uddd8 Relax and Strategize</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the atmosphere while optimizing your farm\u2019s automation.  <br/> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"630\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795090/extras/046614fbe43a46aae4756ba57ea0c420.poster.avif?t=1777025705\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795090/extras/046614fbe43a46aae4756ba57ea0c420.webm?t=1777025705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795090/extras/046614fbe43a46aae4756ba57ea0c420.mp4?t=1777025705\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "MR FARMBOY is a colony farming game with automation. Build your dream farm, grow crops, raise animals, attract villagers, and hire workers to automate everything.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/27